115
00:04:45,453 --> 00:04:48,893
extract the concrete value that is in place

116
00:04:49,182 --> 00:04:51,163
for this placeholder, so to say.

117
00:04:52,983 --> 00:04:55,222
We can get this here and store it in an ID

