218
00:08:41,631 --> 00:08:45,035
So app.css is now interpreted as an ID here

219
00:08:45,405 --> 00:08:46,818
and therefore handled by this route.

220
00:08:47,717 --> 00:08:48,825
Obviously not what we want.

221
00:08:50,238 --> 00:08:52,662
Now, how can we work around that issue here?

222
00:08:53,256 --> 00:08:53,786
Well, the

223
00:08:54,541 --> 00:08:56,548
