232
00:09:15,817 --> 00:09:17,843
With that, we change the request that's

233
00:09:17,843 --> 00:09:19,577
being sent, and since it's now

234
00:09:19,723 --> 00:09:20,387
/static.filename,

235
00:09:22,457 --> 00:09:23,798
it no longer makes it in there,

236
00:09:24,331 --> 00:09:25,672
which is not prepared to handle

237
00:09:25,705 --> 00:09:26,319
/static.filename.

238
00:09:27,514 --> 00:09:28,417
It just wants

239
00:09:29,008 --> 00:09:30,124
/some identifier.

240
00:09:31,208 --> 00:09:31,717
So with that,

241
00:09:33,308 --> 00:09:35,144
if you reload, you got your styles back.

242
00:09:36,094 --> 00:09:37,512
Now if we now finish the course,

243
00:09:38,365 --> 00:09:41,473
we get an error because in course goals EJS,

244
00:09:41,505 --> 00:09:43,919
of course, this shouldn't be goal ID It

245
00:09:43,919 --> 00:09:47,317
should be goals for index i.id, just as

246
00:09:47,350 --> 00:09:48,265
we're doing it for the name.

247
00:09:50,640 --> 00:09:51,027
So if we now

248
00:09:51,559 --> 00:09:53,463
update this, save it and reload,

249
00:09:54,640 --> 00:09:55,044
if I now

250
00:09:55,737 --> 00:09:58,496
