255
00:10:06,716 --> 00:10:08,779
contains that ID of that goal.

256
00:10:09,442 --> 00:10:11,750
And if you enter anything else, any invalid

257
00:10:11,750 --> 00:10:14,459
ID, we get an error here because of our

258
00:10:14,636 --> 00:10:17,072
error handling logic where we simply throw

259
00:10:17,136 --> 00:10:20,053
an error here in the single goal getting

260
00:10:20,342 --> 00:10:22,907
function in case we have an invalid ID.

261
00:10:23,548 --> 00:10:25,840
Of course, you could also throw a NotFound

262
00:10:25,936 --> 00:10:28,324
error here to make sure that the NotFound

263
00:10:28,421 --> 00:10:30,472
checking in App.js again works.

264
00:10:31,402 --> 00:10:33,229
And if you would want to do this, you just

265
00:10:33,229 --> 00:10:36,339
