266
00:10:36,756 --> 00:10:40,288
from Oak. So these 2 extra objects now need

267
00:10:40,288 --> 00:10:40,963
to be imported.

268
00:10:42,295 --> 00:10:44,126
And then here you could create your own

269
00:10:44,222 --> 00:10:47,947
error object by instantiating HTTP error,

270
00:10:48,895 --> 00:10:51,191
and on that you could set the status to

271
00:10:51,785 --> 00:10:53,487
