272
00:10:54,177 --> 00:10:57,292
and throw this custom error. And this error

273
00:10:57,629 --> 00:11:00,744
will be of type HTTP error and will have the

274
00:11:00,744 --> 00:11:01,868
not found status

275
00:11:02,462 --> 00:11:04,933
And therefore our check here will work and

276
00:11:05,029 --> 00:11:06,762
will show the not found page again.

